{
  "description": "Execution preconditions of plan steps (registry/plan-step-kinds.json). `step` shows only the members the preconditions use; `next_step` is the step that follows it in the consented plan, where a precondition reads it; `observed` are facts read right before the step runs, never from the journal. A list fact (registered_distributions, running_distributions) is absent when the list could not be read. Hashes are examples.",
